<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Kurt Abkeimer said he initiated coverage of 360 Communications Co with a buy rating and a 1997 year-end target price of $32 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;As a cellular pure play with a largely rural market portfolio and profitable operations, 360 Communications has demonstrated that there is money to be made in rural America,&quot; Abkeimer said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 23-7/8.</p>
</text>
